OL,3,GNEWSAMusic studio planned for former
OL,4,Acarpet showroom
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former carpet showroom could become a
OL,7,Fmusic rehearsal and recording studio.
OL,9,FMonument Studios wants to transform the
OL,10,Fempty Houghton Carpet Centre, at the
OL,11,Fback of Mautland Street, in
OL,12,FHoughton-le-Spring, near Sunderland.
OL,14,FProposals show four studio spaces
OL,15,Farranged over two floors and a control
OL,16,Froom.
OL,18,FAccording to a noise assessment, impact
OL,19,Fwould be low if several measures are
OL,20,Fput in place, including ceiling
OL,21,Finsulation lining the walls and having
OL,22,Fbuffer zones between the studios.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
